 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids May to June and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those 75 years. In 2025, November to December came in at 37% of normal on the county&rsquo;s middle value, and August to September at 60% that same year. So far in 2026, May to June came in at 161% of normal there. Grid 13658 had its driest year in 1952 at 64% of normal.</p>"}
